   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Golden film warmth: honeyed yellow-orange midtones, warm brown shadows, medium-high saturation (0.38), skin warm and glowing. The classic Contax/Fuji 400H "Villa" glow. Best for: Golden-hour couple portraits, outdoor pheras, sangeet in warm light, Rajasthan palace lawns, ivory/gold outfits. Less suited to blue-hour or LED-lit receptions (use 03).</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
